span style=\"font-family:courier new, courier, monospace\">The only tricky thing with that might be dealing with the courts; it might not be a bad a idea to have a Ghoul/Kinfolk act as the &quot;administrative face&quot; for the bail company. Other than that, Sure!, vampire bounty hunters. It worked for D. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:courier new, courier, monospace\">Also, I could see the other splats working as bounty hunters. Off the top of my head: Syndicate Enforcers, redcaps, maybe nockers, probably some demons, and Imbued hunters (they're just missing &quot;bounty&quot;).</span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:8px\"><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms\">&lt;signature&gt; something witty &lt;/signature&gt;</span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/302-nazfool","name":"Nazfool","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar302_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"753"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-04T11:05:52-08:00","id":754550,"title":"","content":"Is the curse that Bad for Garou<br /> <br /> I get it may be neccessary for kindred to avoid awkward questions...<br /> <br /> How about Trolls or Sidhe?<br /> <br /> especialy one with a knightly bent<br /> <br /> if he just wants a &quot;Dayjob&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attac